{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》計劃於2026年11月19日發售，「GTA流感」一詞隨之受到關注，用來形容玩家可能集體請假或稱病缺勤的現象。不過，The Guardian核查後認為，目前幾乎沒有可靠證據能證明該遊戲會令美國經濟損失約10億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586758.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.802800+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:31:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_hash":"dd864a1ecbff0dda4f8f84d57183b1496d8891d987853a5499c85cc40a155ecf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}